{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friend have been playing Hanafuda games late into the night, enjoying flavorful sake. He fell asleep, but you wanted to drink more. You head to the night market to buy additional sake, only to encounter a mystic ghost in a mirror who demands that you enter the Iron Maiden if you wish to survive until morning...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617180/extras/Kittens_Cut.png?t=1745959222\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An introduction to the Hanafuda deck and all target collections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Core gameplay elements: torch and oil, healing potions, and horror puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquaintance with the main antagonist: The Ghost in the Mirror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter low-level enemies: dolls and kittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain your first chest containing a Hanafuda card</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the first torture mechanism: The Iron Maiden</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617180?t=1745959222","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617180?t=1745959222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617180/98347f1ada7d0ec48fb9e5b14f9f9c3e8131224f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745959222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617180/98347f1ada7d0ec48fb9e5b14f9f9c3e8131224f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745959222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game includes visual effects with a moderate amount of bloo